{"task_id": "HumanEval/1", "solution": "from typing import List\n\n\ndef separate_paren_groups(paren_string: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Parses a string to separate distinct, balanced groups of parentheses.\n    Ignores spaces and assumes top-level groups are not nested within each other.\"\"\"\n    cleaned_string = paren_string.replace(\" \", \"\")\n    result: List[str] = []\n    balance = 0\n    start_index = 0\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(cleaned_string):\n        if char == '(':\n            balance += 1\n        elif char == ')':\n            balance -= 1\n\n        if balance == 0 and start_index <= i:\n            result.append(cleaned_string[start_index : i + 1])\n            start_index = i + 1\n    return result"}
