{"task_id": "HumanEval/82", "solution": "```python\ndef prime_length(string):\n    \"\"\"Checks if the length of a string is a prime number.\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if an integer is a prime number.\"\"\"\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        i = 2\n        while i * i <= n:\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n            i += 1\n        return True\n\n    length = len(string)\n    return _is_prime(length)\n```"}
