{"task_id": "HumanEval/163", "solution": "```python\ndef generate_integers(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given two positive integers a and b, return the even digits between a\n    and b, in ascending order, e.g., generate_integers(2, 8) => [2, 4, 6, 8].\n    \"\"\"\n    min_val = min(a, b)\n    max_val = max(a, b)\n\n    even_numbers = []\n    for i in range(min_val, max_val + 1):\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            even_numbers.append(i)\n\n    return even_numbers\n```"}
